# Celebration & Event Planner Environment Configuration
#
# No environment variables are required to run or evaluate this application.
# The application operates offline-first with deterministic planning engines and a local idea bank.
#
# API keys for optional live LLM ideation are provided strictly at runtime by the user in the UI,
# stored transiently in sessionStorage, and are never persisted or committed.
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# NEVER place secrets or API keys in .env files or prefix them with VITE_ (e.g., VITE_API_KEY).
# Vite embeds all VITE_ prefixed environment variables directly into the client-side JavaScript bundle,
# exposing them publicly to any browser or inspector.
